    "detailed_description": "Ghostbane, is a Co-Op horror game for 1-4 players. Detect paranormal activity, collect evidence of ghosts, hunt ghosts by rituals, and conduct detailed investigations about ghosts in your main base.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/e4cadd23db916cad8056b1b799ad391b.poster.avif?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/e4cadd23db916cad8056b1b799ad391b.webm?t=1736419107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/9acdfbeedefc5a68897d398bbc10b134.webp?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br>Go to the area of paranormal activity. Use the unique Ghostbane equipment to identify the type of ghost. Ritualise the area to capture the identified ghost and hunt it with the ritual.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/da0496c33832a969c356325ebeeb1a54.poster.avif?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/da0496c33832a969c356325ebeeb1a54.webm?t=1736419107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/9a202d3892d9d4cd71aa6b42812a53a3.webp?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br>This is an experience that will push your horror limits. We've prepared it with carefully designed unique scenes and superior graphics. Meticulously crafted environments and eerie details will draw you into the atmosphere. You will feel tension in your bones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/bd21a510e31ed27d498a4dafbcce0233.poster.avif?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/bd21a510e31ed27d498a4dafbcce0233.webm?t=1736419107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/f5910f073b9c5d3657cdd2e2962bcdd5.webp?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br>Ghosts captured as a result of paranormal research and hunting activities can be observed in capsules at your main base. These capsules allow you to analyse a ghost's history, personality, manner of death and relationship to paranormal activity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/ce2da6fdc7150d64ff12b282758a1290.poster.avif?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/ce2da6fdc7150d64ff12b282758a1290.webm?t=1736419107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/def40f666d120d59a92eea2faf87cdf0.webp?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br>Paranormal Hunters! You can try your luck alone, but working in a team of 2-4 people will be more advantageous for you. Remember, teamwork and the use of each team member's strengths will be the key to your success. Are you ready, Hunters?",
    "about_the_game": "Ghostbane, is a Co-Op horror game for 1-4 players. Detect paranormal activity, collect evidence of ghosts, hunt ghosts by rituals, and conduct detailed investigations about ghosts in your main base.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/e4cadd23db916cad8056b1b799ad391b.poster.avif?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/e4cadd23db916cad8056b1b799ad391b.webm?t=1736419107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/9acdfbeedefc5a68897d398bbc10b134.webp?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br>Go to the area of paranormal activity. Use the unique Ghostbane equipment to identify the type of ghost. Ritualise the area to capture the identified ghost and hunt it with the ritual.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/da0496c33832a969c356325ebeeb1a54.poster.avif?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/da0496c33832a969c356325ebeeb1a54.webm?t=1736419107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645490/extras/9a202d3892d9d4cd71aa6b42812a53a3.webp?t=1736419107\" width=600 height=40 /></span><br><br>This is an experience that will push your horror limits. We've prepared it with carefully designed unique scenes and superior graphics. Meticulously craf